{"title":"Post-Apocalyptic Orbs","link":"https://kottke.org/25/01/post-apocalyptic-orbs","date":1736532698000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1299\" alt=\"a floating orb that resembles a building\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/sashie-orbs-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1515\" alt=\"a floating orb that resembles a building\" /></p>\n\n<p>While these might look like they are AI-generated, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DDZypJRxwwj/\">these</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/C5HgNnXSBdh/\">floating</a> <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CxYEmbZRqff/\">orb-structures</a> created by Masakatsu Sashie are actually oil paintings. You can check out more of his work on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/masakatsusashie/\">Instagram</a> and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/masakatsu.sashie/\">Facebook</a>. (via <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/\">colossal</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Masakatsu%20Sashie\">Masakatsu Sashie</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/01/post-apocalyptic-orbs\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd26